 report+=['## Review decision\n','**Stage5 PASS; GO for Stage6 planning, subject to independent review of this package.** Runner, accounting and measurement-validity gates passed for the complete preregistered matrix. Negative/inconclusive policy findings are study results, not validity exclusions. Stage6 must preserve aggregate demand and preregister secondary questions; these results do not authorize tuning the completed comparison. Stop here for review.\n']
